{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "fbe3dcdcb3b752e12a67d4b599f55708eec6f203c71cee918b0b5b44b3dc97ac", "ja": "私、これからますますアイドルとして頑張るから……\n{$P$}くんも、私のこと研究してね♪", "zh": "今后我会以偶像身分继续努力的……\n所以{$P$}，你也要好好研究我喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d7137fc0e148943f5255fedf70d23ed47bd18d46bf80b13ebe2c3618b449f0ab", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ。莉緒の魅力を\nしっかり引き出せるようにしていくよ。", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧。\n我会帮莉绪彻底发挥出魅力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "6b971181b6bc9662949560147cb6a00ad48a80142288ae33198f74df16132e43", "ja": "ふ～ん？　参考までに教えてほしいんだけど……\n例えば、私のどんなトコロが魅力だと思う？", "zh": "嗯～？那我倒是想参考一下你的意见……\n你觉得我哪些地方有魅力啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6cb565825bd8ddcdc78f8b1dc503e4822eb02c2287bff82cb1e690bbd7f8e40e", "ja": "そうだな、スタイルの良さもあるけど……\n莉緒の魅力には、親しみやすさもあると思う。", "zh": "我想想，除了身材好以外……\n我想，平易近人也是莉绪的魅力之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "814bc8be88dc72202ef8d4b9d8ef98c8a6fcbde77b6272b80f85a8ee111a026a", "ja": "親しみやすさ……って、いいコトなの？\nそれに、スタイルの良さが一番じゃないなんて……。", "zh": "平易近人……是好事吗？\n而且，没想到身材好居然不是最大的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "844989d31a9efe97e6e25e0ed2a2f80380fc00a4edc9eacf5ee66b027e0540dc", "ja": "{$P$}くん……\n私、まだまだ色気が足りないってことかしら……？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n这代表我的性感程度还不够吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1006_p", "source_sha256": "212e61b2b0f45301b00308a3e6dc431d4d3498e37e151c066dbcf2e4d8335055", "ja": "いや、そういう意味じゃなくて……\nそれより、そろそろレッスンの時間じゃないのか？", "zh": "不，我不是这个意思……\n比起这个，是不是差不多到训练时间了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0011_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "87eb1d087ffb3a363d062b7329bf7b46609906ea2038184fd3cf816a1724c929", "ja": "あら、ホント。それじゃ{$P$}くん、\nその話、あとでしっかり聞かせてね！", "zh": "哎呀，真的耶。那么{$P$}，\n刚才的事我晚点再好好听你说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
